The most recent Vauxhall Insignia was produced until 2022. The 'GS Line' was a sportier-styled trim level available in the 2017-2022 generation. Common engines for this trim included the 1.5 Turbo 165PS petrol and the 2.0 CDTi 170PS/174PS diesel. I will use data for the 2017-2022 Insignia Grand Sport (hatchback) GS Line trim with the 1.5 Turbo 165PS engine as a representative example, noting that other engines and the Sports Tourer (estate) were also available.

-   **price_usd**: Used prices in the UK for 2017-2022 Insignia GS Line 1.5T 165PS models range from around £6,995 to £11,495. Converting this to USD (approx 1.27 USD to 1 GBP), this is roughly $8,880 to $14,600. This is well below the market average of $52,000. Score: +1.00.
